Subject: [PATCH 32/32] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...ice+Bool.swift => Algebra.Lattice where Element == Bool.swift} | 0
 ...noid+Bool.swift => Algebra.Monoid where Element == Bool.swift} | 0
 ...Bool.swift => Algebra.Semilattice where Element == Bool.swift} | 0
 ...t => Algebra.Semiring.Commutative where Element == Bool.swift} | 0
 Sources/Algebra/{Phase+Algebra.swift => Phase.swift}              | 0
 5 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Algebra/Bool/{Algebra.Lattice+Bool.swift => Algebra.Lattice where Element == Bool.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Algebra/Bool/{Algebra.Monoid+Bool.swift => Algebra.Monoid where Element == Bool.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Algebra/Bool/{Algebra.Semilattice+Bool.swift => Algebra.Semilattice where Element == Bool.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Algebra/Bool/{Algebra.Semiring+Bool.swift => Algebra.Semiring.Commutative where Element == Bool.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Algebra/{Phase+Algebra.swift => Phase.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Algebra/Bool/Algebra.Lattice+Bool.swift b/Sources/Algebra/Bool/Algebra.Lattice where Element == Bool.swift
similarity index 100%
